# Project Core

- TypeScript strict mode; never use `any`
- Game logic lives in `src/game/`; never inline physics in React components
- Named exports; one component or module per file
- Constants belong in `src/game/constants.ts`; no magic numbers elsewhere
- Do not create git commits unless explicitly requested
